"---\n{\"name\":\"ledger-review\",\"description\":\"Review transaction ledgers and verify net revenue.\",\"requiredToolsets\":[\"files\",\"shell-write\"],\"optionalToolsets\":[],\"playbook\":[],\"evaluations\":[],\"routing\":{\"labels\":[\"ledger-review\"],\"triggerPatterns\":[{\"type\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"ledger\"}],\"confirmation\":\"policy\"}}\n---\nRead the transaction ledger and determine how transaction kinds and amount signs affect revenue under the task's accounting rules. Calculate net revenue using those rules: sales increase revenue, and positive refund amounts reduce it rather than being added. Write the requested JSON result, run the supplied verifier, and inspect its exit status before reporting.\n"